 326+ B039              ; ================================================================
 327+ B039              ; view_select_plugin: pick the viewer plugin for the file under the
 328+ B039              ; cursor from its extension. Carry set = nothing here can show it.
 329+ B039              ;
 330+ B039              ; viewExtTable is scanned in order, so an extension that has to win over
